# The policy changes under a running table: the OLT withdraws the multicast
# GEM port (snooping=0), which releases the lease and forgets every group; a
# frame that arrives then is described and not kept; the policy comes back
# with a dynamic list and a static range (one fixed row, the UNI a member) and
# a report is kept again.
0 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=1
end
0 tick
1 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
10 policy
snooping=0
end
11 tick
12 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.2
20 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=1
allow=239.0.0.0-239.255.255.255
static=226.1.2.3-226.1.2.3
end
21 tick
22 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.2
23 state
